        "otherAdvice": "<p><strong>Southbound from Narrabri: </strong>Newell Hwy to Coonabarabran, and Oxley Hwy to Gunnedah.</p><p><strong>Northbound from Gunnedah:</strong> Oxley Hwy to Coonabarabran and Newell Hwy to Narrabri.</p><p>This route is suitable for all vehicles up to and including AB Triple and B Triple combinations and will add around 3 hours to your travel time.</p>",
        "arrangementElements": [],
        "diversions": "<p><strong>Southbound from Narrabri: </strong>Newell Hwy to Coonabarabran, and Oxley Hwy to Gunnedah.</p><p><strong>Northbound from Gunnedah:</strong> Oxley Hwy to Coonabarabran and Newell Hwy to Narrabri.</p><p>This route is suitable for all vehicles up to and including AB Triple and B Triple combinations and will add around 3 hours to your travel time.</p><p>Unless specified otherwise, operators of Class 1,2 &amp; 3 vehicles travelling under a Notice <strong>must</strong> consult their relevant enforceable network map to confirm a suitable <strong>approved</strong> alternative route.</p><p>Operators of Class 1, 2 &amp; 3 vehicles travelling under a Permit <strong>must not</strong> travel off the approved route listed in the permit unless an updated permit is obtained from the NHVR.</p>",
